1
00:00:04,299 --> 00:00:06,602
Metal Cardbot Commentary!

2
00:00:06,602 --> 00:00:09,262
The Mischievous Shadow X!

3
00:00:10,461 --> 00:00:13,169
{Jun} Hey, everyone! Jun here!

4
00:00:13,169 --> 00:00:16,373
{Jun} Let's watch another episode of Metal Cardbot together!

5
00:00:16,373 --> 00:00:18,829
{Jun} It's "Metal Cardbot Commentary" time!

6
00:00:18,929 --> 00:00:21,873
Shadow X, setup!

7
00:00:21,873 --> 00:00:25,367
{Shadow X} Hey, everybody! My name is Shadow X!

8
00:00:25,367 --> 00:00:28,667
{Shadow X} I wanted to be in one of these things, too!

9
00:00:28,667 --> 00:00:32,067
{Jun} Nice to meet you, Shadow X!

10
00:00:32,067 --> 00:00:34,390
{Jun} Today, let's watch the story

11
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:36,712
{Jun} of when the prankster Shadow X showed up!

12
00:00:36,712 --> 00:00:38,948
Shall we get started?

13
00:00:44,753 --> 00:00:45,468
Pass it here!

14
00:00:47,588 --> 00:00:51,090
{Shadow X} Jun! What game were you playing here?

15
00:00:51,090 --> 00:00:53,683
{Jun} Oh, this is Soccer!

16
00:00:53,683 --> 00:00:56,826
{Jun} You win by getting the ball in the other team's goal.

17
00:00:56,826 --> 00:00:59,587
{Shadow X} Wouldn't it be easier to just pick it up with your hands and put it in?

18
00:00:59,587 --> 00:01:02,603
{Jun} Then that would make it basketball...

19
00:01:02,603 --> 00:01:05,364
{Shadow X} Then what about hitting it with a stick and sending it flying?

20
00:01:05,364 --> 00:01:07,364
{Jun} That's baseball!

21
00:01:07,364 --> 00:01:10,787
{Jun} Wait a minute... you already know this, don't you?

22
00:01:10,787 --> 00:01:15,043
{Shadow X} Jun is the most fun to tease!

23
00:01:15,043 --> 00:01:16,980
What just happened?

24
00:01:20,293 --> 00:01:22,128
Okay, bye!

25
00:01:22,128 --> 00:01:23,896
Anna! See you tomorrow!

26
00:01:32,698 --> 00:01:33,531
Jun?

27
00:01:35,247 --> 00:01:37,201
You should watch where you're going.

28
00:01:39,786 --> 00:01:40,848
What was that?

29
00:01:42,087 --> 00:01:44,897
It does seem like a childish prank.

30
00:01:44,897 --> 00:01:46,444
Who are you calling childish?!

31
00:01:47,348 --> 00:01:48,257
Who's there?!

32
00:01:52,253 --> 00:01:53,141
What was that?!

33
00:01:54,670 --> 00:01:55,731
Is it invisible?

34
00:01:56,598 --> 00:01:57,748
What? What's going on?

35
00:01:57,748 --> 00:01:58,884
Haha!

36
00:02:01,099 --> 00:02:02,694
Show yourself!

37
00:02:02,694 --> 00:02:04,944
You must be a Metal Cardbot like us!

38
00:02:04,944 --> 00:02:07,304
So you figured out, huh?

39
00:02:07,304 --> 00:02:09,396
Stealth mode, off!

40
00:02:10,771 --> 00:02:14,227
{Jun} A plane that can hide turn invisible...

41
00:02:14,227 --> 00:02:16,581
{Jun} Shadow X, you're pretty cool!

42
00:02:16,581 --> 00:02:18,189
{Shadow X} Aren't I?

43
00:02:18,189 --> 00:02:21,591
{Shadow X} But I'm not a plane, I'm a helicopter!

44
00:02:21,591 --> 00:02:23,046
{Jun} Oh, right!

45
00:02:23,046 --> 00:02:25,201
{Jun} Theo explained it best.

46
00:02:25,201 --> 00:02:27,025
{Jun} He said you're some kind of jet, right?

47
00:02:27,025 --> 00:02:29,222
{Shadow X} HE! LI! COP! TER!

48
00:02:29,222 --> 00:02:33,903
{Shadow X} Technically speaking, a VTOL! Vertical Take-Off and Landing aircraft!

49
00:02:33,903 --> 00:02:37,373
{Jun} V..T?... That's too hard to remember!

50
00:02:37,373 --> 00:02:39,287
{Jun} Can't I just call you an airplane?

51
00:02:39,287 --> 00:02:42,596
{Shadow X} Tch... Jun, are you just doing this on purpose?!

52
00:02:42,596 --> 00:02:46,991
{Jun} Heheh! It's revenge for earlier!

53
00:02:47,292 --> 00:02:48,954
So that was all you!

54
00:02:48,954 --> 00:02:50,182
Why are you pulling pranks on everyone?

55
00:02:50,182 --> 00:02:51,634
Isn't it obvious?

56
00:02:51,634 --> 00:02:52,836
I. Just.

57
00:02:52,836 --> 00:02:53,372
Don't.

58
00:02:53,372 --> 00:02:53,781
Like.

59
00:02:53,781 --> 00:02:54,740
You!

60
00:02:59,241 --> 00:03:02,109
{Shadow X} Jun! Why is she taking a video of herself dancing?

61
00:03:02,109 --> 00:03:03,776
{Shadow X} Is she giving it as a gift or something?

62
00:03:03,776 --> 00:03:06,073
{Jun} No~

63
00:03:06,073 --> 00:03:09,370
{Jun} Vera wants to be famous on the internet.

64
00:03:09,370 --> 00:03:10,669
{Shadow X} Huh?!

65
00:03:10,669 --> 00:03:13,569
{Shadow X} I wanna be famous too! I wanna dance!

66
00:03:13,569 --> 00:03:15,157
{Jun} You can't!

67
00:03:15,157 --> 00:03:18,745
{Jun} The identity of the Metal Cardbots needs to remain a secret!

68
00:03:18,745 --> 00:03:21,727
We aren't allowed to be here! Let's get out of here before we get in trouble!

69
00:03:21,727 --> 00:03:24,447
Hang on. Something doesn't seem right.

70
00:03:24,447 --> 00:03:25,920
Hey! Vera!

71
00:03:31,463 --> 00:03:32,692
He's going up towards the cranes!

72
00:03:35,420 --> 00:03:38,175
First, we'll need to get Shadow X to come down!

73
00:03:40,275 --> 00:03:43,078
Ha! Took you long enough to get here!

74
00:03:43,078 --> 00:03:45,733
You're so slow! I was getting bored!

75
00:03:45,733 --> 00:03:46,966
This guy...

76
00:03:46,966 --> 00:03:48,448
Blue Cop! Prepare for battle!

77
00:03:48,448 --> 00:03:49,258
Alright.

78
00:03:51,633 --> 00:03:52,526
Blue Cop!

79
00:03:54,942 --> 00:03:59,855
Haha! Looks like I won, blue-haired kid!

80
00:03:59,855 --> 00:04:03,551
Too bad! Looks like I won't become one of your underlings.

81
00:04:03,551 --> 00:04:06,260
You keep saying underling...

82
00:04:06,260 --> 00:04:09,025
but I have never made any Metal Cardbot my underling!

83
00:04:09,025 --> 00:04:12,594
{Jun} You're so obsessed with underlings. What would you do if you had an underling of your own?

84
00:04:12,594 --> 00:04:16,572
{Shadow X} If I had an underling, I'd boss them around like crazy!

85
00:04:16,572 --> 00:04:18,084
{Jun} You can't do that!

86
00:04:18,084 --> 00:04:20,997
{Jun} Bossing others around isn't nice!

87
00:04:20,997 --> 00:04:24,137
{Shadow X} I'd play hide-and-seek with my underling in stealth mode!

88
00:04:24,137 --> 00:04:26,978
{Shadow X} Just try and find me! Hard, right? Heheh!

89
00:04:26,978 --> 00:04:31,514
{Jun} Does Shadow X treat his friends like underlings...?

90
00:04:31,514 --> 00:04:33,167
But only if you can defeat us!

91
00:04:33,167 --> 00:04:34,540
What?

92
00:04:34,540 --> 00:04:36,850
Let's have a rematch, Shadow X!

93
00:04:36,850 --> 00:04:39,367
I promise I will seal you for sure!

94
00:04:40,968 --> 00:04:44,324
Next time we meet, I'll be sure to blow you away with my Heli-Tornado!

95
00:04:44,324 --> 00:04:48,175
That's what you think. But I have a secret weapon that can beat your Heli-Tornado!

96
00:04:48,175 --> 00:04:50,396
Huh? A secret weapon?!

97
00:04:54,024 --> 00:04:56,356
I-I accept your challenge!

98
00:04:56,356 --> 00:05:00,817
Next time we meet, we will see if your secret weapon can beat my Heli-Tornado!

99
00:05:00,817 --> 00:05:04,478
I'm not leaving because I'm scared of some "secret weapon" or anything.

100
00:05:04,478 --> 00:05:06,735
Don't take this the wrong way!

101
00:05:07,834 --> 00:05:09,939
{Jun} Well, everyone?

102
00:05:09,939 --> 00:05:13,636
{Jun} This is the first time I failed to seal a Cardbot...

103
00:05:13,636 --> 00:05:18,103
{Jun} In any case, look forward to the next "Metal Cardbot Commentary"!

